# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and fill in whichever key(s) you have.
# deploy.sh loads .env automatically before starting the server, so you don't
# need to re-export these every time you redeploy.
#
# Neither of these is the same as a claude.ai or ChatGPT Plus subscription -
# both are separate, billed-by-usage API keys from that provider's own
# developer console (console.anthropic.com / platform.openai.com).
#
# You can also skip this file entirely and type a key into the app's own
# "API Keys" panel instead - that's stored in your browser only and needs no
# server-side setup at all.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
